5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! Let's all try our best to find the werewolf and keep our village safe!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,...Hello.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's keep this logical. We have five people, meaning two are not on the village's side.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let's be kind to one another while we solve this.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue-san. Let's work together harmoniously to find the truth.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,Does anyone have any initial thoughts or strategies they want to share?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't really know what to say.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,Not yet. We have no information. We should observe how people react once the first night passes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a very sensible plan, Asuka-san.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,I'll just listen for now and see if I notice anything unusual.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
