31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Everyone, I have something important to say. I'm the Seer, and I checked Asuka-san. She is the werewolf!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,...What? Already?,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,That is a very bold claim. You could be the werewolf trying to frame me immediately.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh my, such a surprise so early. Are you sure, Yumi-chan?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"It's very fast, but Yumi-san seems very sincere.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm absolutely sure! I saw it with my own eyes! Please, we have to vote for Asuka-san!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't want to make a mistake. But Yumi-san sounds so certain.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,A Seer claiming a werewolf on day one is a common tactic for the wolf to gain trust. Think logically.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Asuka-san, you are usually so calm. Your logic is sound, but Yumi-chan's energy is very honest.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"If Yumi-san is lying, she's risking a lot by coming out so early.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka-san, please tell us the truth! I know what I saw!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi-san, is there any chance you're mistaken?","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I am human. Yumi is simply attempting to eliminate me to secure a win for the wolves.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It's hard to decide, but I feel we should trust our young Yumi-chan.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'm leaning toward believing Yumi-san. The risk of her lying is too high.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Please, everyone! Let's vote for Asuka-san now!","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll trust the majority.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"This is an illogical conclusion, but I cannot force you to see the truth.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I'm sorry, Asuka-san, but I believe Yumi-chan.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's vote.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
